sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as API Gateway
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant Svc as Feature Service
  participant DB as Primary DB
  participant Cache as Redis Cache

  User->>UI: Submit action
  UI->>API: POST /feature (payload)
  API->>Auth: Validate token
  Auth-->>API: Token OK
  API->>Cache: Check recent result
  Cache-->>API: Miss
  API->>Svc: Process request
  Svc->>DB: Read/write
  DB-->>Svc: Result
  Svc-->>API: Response
  API->>Cache: Write short TTL
  API-->>UI: 200 OK (data)
  UI-->>User: Render update
